{"c":[{"id":"61fbb8f64668e9b17ced31ae970f6ec0243d8c957831ea7327bca1389c9e6fe6","sum":"equal_grain_pair is a fold-test oracle only; fold_request walks adjacent same-grain ViewNodes itself; sys.version_info is immediately after import sys so 3.10 prints the floor message instead of ModuleNotFoundError.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260824T174900Z-adbb0c6c6a991bca","text":"equal_grain_pair is a fold-test oracle only; the copied driver does not keep it. fold_request still walks adjacent same-grain ViewNodes itself.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260824T174934Z-b3f3d92f255bc910","text":"summem checks sys.version_info immediately after import sys and before import tomllib; Python 3.10 prints SumMem needs Python 3.11 or newer instead of ModuleNotFoundError.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"9f3b2086879920a2ae41118c93866581f48ad4193b14fd63236911f2101ff135","sum":"3.11 floor is import-time before tomllib (#42/#38). Root wake prints how_to_text under Usage; AGENTS.md is bootstrap only (wake-if-needed, note, writer-only).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260824T175246Z-a3c8d06b34d1a7c4","text":"PR #42 feat/require-python closes #38: import-time 3.11 floor before tomllib; Python 3.10 prints SumMem needs Python 3.11 or newer.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T003315Z-1061fd623922ceb6","text":"Root wake prints how_to_text under == SumMem Usage ==; the AGENTS.md prefix is the bootstrap only (wake-if-needed, note, writer-only).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
